QA round 18, iOS part. iPhone 18 Pro simulator 7C1A4352-E11F-495C-A59C-34FB90FF2EF7, debug build
(`flutter run --dart-define-from-file=google.json`, API http://localhost:5076). Driven from the host by the XCUITest driver
mobile/integration_test/qa/r18_ios_driver/ (r18_ios_ui.sh dump / tap). The driver auto-taps "Continue" on the system alert
'"zaypos_app" Wants to Use "accounts.google.com" to Sign In'. Email addresses → <google-account>; the Google Cloud project
number → <project-number>. Format: process | XCUIElement.ElementType raw value | label | value | [frame in points].

Which simulator has a Google session: only the iPhone 18 Pro has Google cookies
(SafariViewService.binarycookies); the iPhone Duo has none. Neither shows an account chooser (see step 4).

